Header Loop Region Background: #00000022
Header Time Selection Across All Lanes Fill: #262626CC
Header Time Selection Across All Lanes Stroke: #F5F5F5
Header Time Selection Cursor Stroke: #F5F5F5
Header Time Selection Fill: #1E1E1ECC
Header Time Selection Standby Cursor Stroke: #BDBDBD
Header Time Selection Standby Fill: #FFFFFF06
Header Time Selection Standby Stroke: #BDBDBD
Header Time Selection Stroke: #F5F5F5
Loop Region Background: #FFFFFF14
Time Selection Across All Lanes Fill: #FFFFFF22
Time Selection Across All Lanes Stroke: #F5F5F5
Time Selection Cursor Stroke: #F5F5F5
